{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"那些快乐他舍不得抹去，也不再为盼着长久相爱羞愧，但他不能把这份盼望变成对方永不改变的要求。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I129\", \"I130\", \"I132\", \"I138\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I128\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"以前把对方的心意当成必须交出的东西，已经扰乱了他珍惜的亲密，他不愿再让这样的要求妨碍自己自由地爱。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I131\", \"I133\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I64\", \"I65\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"虽然不再这样要求，他也管不了以后怎样，想到幸福可能改变还是会疼，仍有一点不甘心，却不再怪自己舍不得。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I134\", \"I135\", \"I136\", \"I139\", \"I140\", \"I143\", \"I144\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I118\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他不愿为了少疼就减少快乐或收回心意，仍想靠近对方，更舍不得这个爱过才如此留恋的自己，不想退回从前。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I137\", \"I141\", \"I142\", \"I145\", \"I146\", \"I147\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I120\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e1ed3b73-96cb-4932-880c-cdcaa07b72df", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261101T045526911751Z", "elapsed_seconds": 108.079, "completed_utc": "2026-11-01T04:57:15.011313+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "29ab6ee436b9c27ef6cf32ab4caa34ba57969d49d8539750402b40c8aa52108f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib"